OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK calls for 'proper
OL,4,Acriminal justice system'
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's deputy leader has said four
OL,7,Fof five men killed in the A66 crash, in
OL,8,Fwhich two police officers also died,
OL,9,Fshould have been "nowhere near the
OL,10,Fstreets".
OL,12,FRichard Tice MP said sentences were
OL,13,F"not tough enough" and called for a
OL,14,F"proper criminal justice system" where
OL,15,F"five years should mean five years, 10
OL,16,Fyears should mean 10 years".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
