OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK calls for 'proper
OL,4,Acriminal justice system'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of the party's annual
OL,7,Fconference, he said four of those
OL,8,Fkilled in August's wrong-way crash had
OL,9,F37 previous convictions between them,
OL,10,Fincluding for assaulting a police
OL,11,Fofficer.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Justice has been asked
OL,14,Ffor comment. The government's prisoner
OL,15,Fearly release scheme, aimed at easing
OL,16,Fprison overcrowding, is scheduled to
OL,17,Fstart in October.
